
Use pwd to print your current location.

Navigate (cd) into the target sub-folder.

List (ls) the contents to find the specified file or folder.

Navigate further into sub-directories or back out (cd ..) as instructed.

Use clear to reset the terminal screen when finished

cd .. — Moves up one directory level.

cd ../.. — Moves up two directory levels.

cd ../../../ — Moves up three directory levels.
